<div class="bb-quote">Quote:<br /><blockquote class="bb-quote-body">One-shots are not considered or counted as &ldquo;cards in play.&rdquo; That means Into the Stratosphere or Cedistic Dissonant cannot destroy one-shots that are currently being played.
&nbsp;
</blockquote></div>
